# Text files are stored and checked out with LF everywhere. gofmt, the shell
# scripts, Dockerfiles and SQL that run on the Linux server all expect LF,
# and a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise convert them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.exe  binary
*.zip  binary
*.woff2 binary
